<p>It's an interesting take on the situation. I'm going to chew on it a while to decide if I like it or not (no vote for now).</p>
<p>One thing; I don't think potassium chloride would be a good choice. My preference would be something like an induced air embolism. Or &quot;&#8230;a variety of different substances and causes, to ensure that there was no trend for some bored statistician to pick up on.&quot; But that's me.</p>

